      "P": {
        "slot": "P",
        "id": "VexP",
        "name": "Doom 'n Gloom",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Vex periodically becomes empowered, causing her next basic Ability to fear enemies and interrupt dashes. Whenever a nearby enemy dashes, Vex applies a mark that can be consumed for bonus damage that also reduces the cooldown of her empowered state.",
        "bodyHtml": "Every 16 seconds Vex becomes afflicted with Doom, causing her next basic Ability to <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Knock Down</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Fear</span> enemies for 1.5 seconds.<br /><br />Whenever a nearby enemy dashes or blinks, Vex marks them with <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Gloom</span> for 6 seconds. Vex's next Attack against a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Gloomed</span> enemy deals an additional <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(25% Ability Power) magic damage</span> and reduces this Ability's Cooldown by 25%.",
